{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.poster.avif?t=1757067438\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.webm?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/62e53c90985fc7097b00f43e6d1ee7cd.mp4?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Hijong Park's Defender Patrol</strong> is a low-poly helicopter combat flight simulator featuring simple but fully interactable cockpit system, playable in both the monitor and Virtual-reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game aims to be a middle ground between serious study flight simulator and arcade action for light observation helicopter, with a simple low poly graphics that resembles the flight simulators from MS-DOS era. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.poster.avif?t=1757067438\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.webm?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/94f5921820551a08f069001ea938ac3c.mp4?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-realistic flight model, which is a lot simpler than real life helicopters but still gives the feeling of riding a helicopter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directly interact with switches in the cockpit. You don't need to memorize tons of keybinds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers 3 different play modes for flight sim enthusiasts :</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Flatscreen:</strong> play in just simple flat screen monitor with joysticks or Keyboard and mouse. Various snap view functions are available to aid your limited vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. TrackIR:</strong> Use your TrackIR device to quickly look around the cockpit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. VR:</strong> Play with VR controllers alone, or mix some joysticks. Various combos are possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated scenes and missions offering completely unexpectable encounters during your duty!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><table><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.poster.avif?t=1757067438\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.webm?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.mp4?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></th><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.poster.avif?t=1757067438\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.webm?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.mp4?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></th></tr></table><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons in each 2 pylons of MD-500MG to destroy things, or carry 4 troops with MD-500E.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter various AI units including infantries, MANPADS, stationary turrets, armored cars, tanks, howitzers, and SPAAVs. Kill bad ones, help good ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly with your AI helicopter wingmen to complete missions, and fight with enemy AI helicopters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ANVIS for night operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of ammo? Draw your victorious model 10 and keep fighting for your victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you buy this game instead of just playing demo, you can use MD-530F Defender : the upgraded variant of MD-500MG featuring twin minigun pylons and improved engine !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982130?t=1757067438","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982130?t=1757067438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/4a776acc1d3a4d772f81ea7c518938cbfecfe7eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757067438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/4a776acc1d3a4d772f81ea7c518938cbfecfe7eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757067438","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","i