fe helicopters but still gives the feeling of riding a helicopter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directly interact with switches in the cockpit. You don't need to memorize tons of keybinds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers 3 different play modes for flight sim enthusiasts :</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Flatscreen:</strong> play in just simple flat screen monitor with joysticks or Keyboard and mouse. Various snap view functions are available to aid your limited vision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. TrackIR:</strong> Use your TrackIR device to quickly look around the cockpit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. VR:</strong> Play with VR controllers alone, or mix some joysticks. Various combos are possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated scenes and missions offering completely unexpectable encounters during your duty!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><table><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.poster.avif?t=1757067438\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.webm?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4a5b4d4a0d1cf54b4ca217b4c886ff64.mp4?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></th><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.poster.avif?t=1757067438\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.webm?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/extras/4c85bd638ad633b5e252921f9541e5b1.mp4?t=1757067438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></th></tr></table><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons in each 2 pylons of MD-500MG to destroy things, or carry 4 troops with MD-500E.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter various AI units including infantries, MANPADS, stationary turrets, armored cars, tanks, howitzers, and SPAAVs. Kill bad ones, help good ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly with your AI helicopter wingmen to complete missions, and fight with enemy AI helicopters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ANVIS for night operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of ammo? Draw your victorious model 10 and keep fighting for your victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you buy this game instead of just playing demo, you can use MD-530F Defender : the upgraded variant of MD-500MG featuring twin minigun pylons and improved engine !</p>","developers":["Hijong Park"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982130/446db4a6b2451ee0796d582d09210db05975c578/header.jpg?t=1757067438","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Hijong Park's Defender Patrol \u00a9 2024-2025 Hijong Park. All rights reserved. Distributed by PsychoFlux Entertainment.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191250,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191250/movie480.mp4?t=1756955439","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191250/movie_max.mp4?t=1756955439"